research_summary:
Huiyuan Yang is working with Dr.Akane Sano as Postdoctoral Research Associate at Rice University. Before that he was working with Dr.Lijun Yin in the Graphics and Image Computing (GAIC) Laboratory in the Department of Computer Science Binghamton Univeristy, SUNY. Huiyuan earned his Master in Eletronics and Communication Engineering in the Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing in 2014, and his B.E in Wuhan University in 2011. | Human-Centric AI;
Multimodal Machine Learning;
Machine Learning in Healthcare
